{"seq":3,"slug":"service-mesh","title":"服务网格","docCount":5,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-mesh-concepts","title":"服务网格核心概念","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/service-mesh-concepts","wordCount":1485,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"istio-linkerd","title":"Istio 与 Linkerd 实战","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/istio-linkerd","wordCount":1265,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"mesh-observability","title":"服务网格可观测性","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/mesh-observability","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"istio-practice","title":"Istio 服务网格实践","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/istio-practice","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"service-discovery-lb","title":"服务发现与负载均衡","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/service-discovery-lb","wordCount":1667,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 服务网格 简介\n\n本章介绍服务网格技术，讲解如何在基础设施层面为微服务提供统一的流量管理、安全通信和可观测性能力，从核心概念到 Istio 实践再到进阶特性。\n\n**服务网格核心概念**阐述服务网格的架构理念，介绍数据平面与控制平面的分工协作，分析 Sidecar 代理模式的工作原理以及服务网格解决的核心问题。\n\n**Istio 实践与流量管理**以 Istio 为例讲解服务网格的部署配置，深入分析流量路由、故障注入、超时重试和熔断等流量管理能力的实践方法。\n\n**网格可观测性与安全**讲解服务网格提供的自动化可观测性能力和 mTLS 零信任安全通信，以及授权策略和流量加密的配置实践。\n\n建议读者先理解服务网格要解决的问题和核心架构，再通过 Istio 实操建立实践经验，最后深入可观测性和安全特性。\n"}